      "writtenOn": "2026-09-28T19:35:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`OpenSSLGeneralNames` did this before:\n\n```\nASN1_STRING* str \u003d value.release();\nstr-\u003etype \u003d V_ASN1_UTF8STRING;\n```\n\nThis doesn\u0027t work with OpenSSL 4.0 anymore because `ASN1_STRING` is now opaque. The string must be initialised with the type directly. `V_ASN1_OCTET_STRING` is what\u0027s being used in `ASN1_STRING_new()`.",
